Student Report Card System

A simple Python program to manage student marks and generate report cards.

Features
Enter student name and roll number
Enter marks for 5 subjects
Calculate total marks
Calculate percentage
Assign grades
Display PASS or FAIL result
Search for a student using roll number
Display subject-wise marks
Calculate the average marks of all students for each subject
Technologies Used
Python
How It Works

The program first asks for the number of students. For each student, it collects their name, roll number, and marks for 5 subjects.

It then calculates the student's total, percentage, grade, and result.

The program also provides subject-wise analytics by calculating the average marks obtained by all students in each subject.

Example
Subject 1 Average: 78.33
Subject 2 Average: 82.0
Subject 3 Average: 75.67
Subject 4 Average: 85.0
Subject 5 Average: 80.33
How to Run
python student_report.py

This project is created for practicing Python loops, dictionaries, lists, conditions, and basic data processing.
